# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF（原先 index.html/judge.js 等为 CRLF，problems.js 为 LF，混合）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做换行转换、不参与 diff 文本化
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.glb  binary

# 构建产物与快照：GitHub 语言统计中排除
dist/**     linguist-generated
package-lock.json linguist-generated -diff
tests/baseline.json linguist-generated
